TI  - Unveiling the Modes of Action of a Recombinant Antimicrobial Peptide, Hepcidin (rGf-Hep), from Gerres filamentosus Against Pathogenic Vibrios: Membrane Disintegration and Reactive Oxygen Species Generation Leading to Cell Death
