TI  - A Novel Hepcidin Isoform Jd-Hep from the Sin Croaker Johnius dussumieri (Cuvier, 1830): Recombinant Expression and Insights into the Antibacterial Property and Modes of Action
PY  - 2025
T2  - Marine Biotechnology
VL  - 27
