TI  - In silico molecular and functional characterization of a dual function antimicrobial peptide, hepcidin (GIFT-Hep), isolated from genetically improved farmed tilapia (GIFT, Oreochromis niloticus)
PY  - 2023
T2  - Journal of Genetic Engineering and Biotechnology
VL  - 21
